{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05698","headline":"奉和圣制上巳祓禊应制 · 崔国辅","name":"奉和圣制上巳祓禊应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元巳秦中节，吾君灞上游。\n鸣銮通禁苑，别馆遶芳洲。\n鵷鹭千官列，鱼龙百戏浮。\n桃花春欲尽，谷雨夜来收。\n庆向尧樽祝，欢从楚棹讴。\n逸诗何足对，窅作掩东周。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔国辅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05698.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05698","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}